# Sindhi in Perso-Arabic script. espeak-ng voice "sd". Written for uccharan.
# The
# script is decoded like an Indic script: every consonant letter carries a
# short vowel unless a vowel letter, a vowel mark or jazm follows, and the
# Hindi-type deletion and stress rules apply. In compatible mode common words
# come from the word table `data/sd.ucd`.

